## What I Built

### 1. Backend iFlow (Certificate Expiry Detection)
- Timer triggers daily at 8 AM
- Reads certificate data from backend system (employee-wise)
- Compares expiry dates with current date
- Categorizes certificates into: Active, Expiring Soon (30/15/7 days), Expired

### 2. Email Alert System
- Sends automated emails to employees 30, 15, and 7 days before expiry
- HR team receives weekly summary of all expiring certificates
- Uses SMTP (Gmail, port 587) with Groovy scripting

### 3. SAP Fiori Dashboard (Frontend)
Built a basic SAP Fiori UI with multiple screens:

## Fiori Dashboard Features

### Page 1: Certification Management Dashboard

| Feature | What It Shows |
|:---|:---|
| **Total Certifications** | 50 total certificates in system |
| **Completed** | 30 certificates completed successfully |
| **Expiring Soon** | 12 certificates expiring in next 30 days |
| **Expired** | 8 certificates already expired |
| **Department Compliance** | Integration, Management, Cloud, Development, SAP |
| **Expiry Trend Chart** | Monthly breakdown of certificates expiring (Jan-Dec) |
| **Quick Actions** | Employee Data view, Send Alerts button |

### Page 2: Employee Data Table

| Column | Description |
|:---|:---|
| Name | Employee full name |
| Email | Wipro email address |
| Team | Development, SAP, Integration, Cloud |
| Competency | Frontend, SAP Fiori, SAP CPI, OpenShift, SAP PI/PO |
| Location | Pune, Hyderabad, Noida |
| Role | UI Developer, SAP UI5 Developer, Software Engineer, etc. |

**Filters Available:** All Teams, All Locations, Search bar

### Page 3: Employee Certificate Details (Example: Ram Kumar)

| Section | Details |
|:---|:---|
| **Completed** | SAP CPI Integration (Expired: 2026-03-01) |
| **Expired** | SAP ABAP (Expired: 2025-05-01) |
| **Pending** | SAP BTP Extension (70% progress) |
| **Expiring Soon** | Fiori/UI5 (Expiry: 2026-06-15) |

## Technical Details

### iFlow Components Used

| Component | Purpose |
|:---|:---|
| Timer (JMS) | Triggers daily at 8 AM for expiry check |
| Content Modifier | Processes certificate data from backend |
| Groovy Script | Date calculations and email logic |
| SMTP Adapter | Sends email alerts to employees and HR |
| OData Service | Connects Fiori frontend to backend data |

### Email Alert Logic
- **30 days before expiry:** First reminder
- **15 days before expiry:** Second reminder  
- **7 days before expiry:** Final reminder
- **After expiry:** Alert to HR and employee

## Testing
- ✅ Timer triggers iFlow correctly at scheduled time
- ✅ Email alerts sent at 30/15/7 day thresholds
- ✅ Fiori dashboard displays real-time data from backend
- ✅ Search and filter working on Employee Data table
- ✅ Employee certificate details page shows correct status

